Current implementation:
- src/speech.* implements speech detection and recognition-job planning using
  the public sherpa-onnx C API. Long recordings preserve every original sample.
- src/transcript_text.* implements Unicode-aware transcript assembly using GLib.
- No source, build target, runtime process, or plugin from apps/voice-input or
  fcitx5-vinput is required by the application.

Historical provenance:
The earlier Hyprvoice implementation delivered on 2026-10-03 (6bcd93af) adapted
vad_trimmer.*, text_join.h, and quiet-boundary splitting from fcitx5-vinput
(https://github.com/xifan2333/fcitx5-vinput) and its Mobius fork, snapshot d571be21.
Those helper files and that splitting implementation have now been removed.
